  "legacy:2021-115-6221e01950": {
    "title": {
      "source": "Belongs特别作品发售",
      "en": "Belongs Special Release"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "520特别熔币饼\n熔古币配方银，纯手工打制，18K金孔。\n宽约3.4厘米、高约3.8厘米，重量约24克。\n正面纯手工22K花朵、卷叶、羽毛雕。\n背面唐草爱心雕、錾刻2021.5.20。\n说明：本品特别赠送免费刻名服务；售价为特殊优惠价格。由于作品的独特含义，购买对象*仅限*伴侣，刻名亦必须为双人名。敬请理解。",
      "en": "520 Special Melted-Coin Disc\nSilver alloy made with melted antique coins, hammered entirely by hand, with an 18K gold-lined hole.\nWidth approx. 3.4 cm, height approx. 3.8 cm, weight approx. 24 g.\nFront: entirely handmade 22K flower, scrolling-leaf and feather carving.\nBack: scrolling-vine heart carving, with 2021.5.20 chased into the surface.\nNote: This piece includes complimentary name engraving and is offered at a special reduced price. Because of its particular meaning, it is available *only* to couples, and the engraving must contain both names. Thank you for understanding."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "Belongs特别作品发售",
      "en": "Belongs Special Release"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
  "legacy:2021-122-83ea808aad": {
    "title": {
      "source": "它翱翔在云霄最高处，也盘踞在山峦乱石间。",
      "en": "It soars above the clouds and settles among mountain rocks."
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "它是雄踞天际的神鸟，亦为划破长空的猛禽。\n它是捕猎者，更是守护者。\n我们满怀虔诚赤子之心，悉心制作、呈现这件作品。\n熔币银鹰盾\n古银币熔银配制，纯手工制作，整体呈盾型凹凸。\n最高处约5.2厘米、最宽处约3.8厘米、重量约33克。\n正面全鹰雕，鹰嘴24K贴金、特制22K厚点金。\n背面卷叶三花雕。\n这枚鹰盾将永久守护我们胸中那份赤诚。",
      "en": "A sacred bird commanding the sky, a raptor cutting through it.\nIt is a hunter, and more than that, a guardian.\nWith a sincere and devoted heart, we carefully make and present this piece.\nMelted-Coin Silver Eagle Shield\nMade entirely by hand from silver alloy prepared with melted antique silver coins, with a raised and recessed shield form.\nApproximately 5.2 cm at its tallest, 3.8 cm at its widest, and 33 g.\nFront: full eagle carving, 24K gold overlay on the beak, specially made thick 22K gold accent.\nBack: scrolling leaves with three carved flowers.\nThis eagle shield will always protect the sincerity within our hearts."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "它翱翔在云霄最高处，也盘踞在山峦乱石间。",
      "en": "It soars above the clouds and settles among mountain rocks."
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
  "legacy:2021-129-1496fed766": {
    "title": {
      "source": "Belongs六一特别作品发售",
      "en": "Belongs Children's Day Special Release"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "真心喜爱手工银饰的人，大多带有几分童真。\n生而为人，本是灵与肉的结合。儿时的我们，坐享天国的纯真和无忧。\n进入“成年人的世界”后，却渐渐沦于凡间，那份本真的快乐也渐行渐远。\n所以在这个并不属于成年人的节日里，我们仍然发布四件特别作品。\n为召唤、为找寻、为唤醒、为远行、为逃离、为救赎。总有一种理由，让你从现实中暂时脱离，找回童年的快乐。\n特别版贝羽\n直径约1.9厘米，外形模具处理，手工打磨，羽骨纯手工制作。\n正面细绒毛雕。\n背面点金、卷草雕、雕刻字样“on the road”，意指一往无前。",
      "en": "Those who truly love handmade silver often retain a little childlike wonder.\nWe are spirit and body together. As children, we enjoy a heavenly innocence and ease.\nEntering the adult world, we gradually become earthbound, and that simple joy grows distant.\nSo, on a holiday not meant for adults, we are still releasing four special pieces.\nTo call, seek, awaken, travel, escape or find redemption: there is always a reason to step outside daily life for a moment and find childhood joy again.\nSpecial-Edition Shell Feather\nApproximately 1.9 cm in diameter, mold-shaped and hand-polished, with an entirely handmade feather shaft.\nFront: fine down-feather carving.\nBack: gold accent, scrolling-vine carving and the words \"on the road,\" expressing the resolve to keep going."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "Belongs六一特别作品发售",
      "en": "Belongs Children's Day Special Release"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
