  "legacy:2021-168-1540043e0d": {
    "title": {
      "source": "马",
      "en": "Horse"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "马，俊朗、健壮而挺拔。天性骄傲，骁勇而烈悍。\n\n原本是在草原上不羁放纵爱自由的野生神兽，沐浴雨露阳光，饮食天地精华。\n\n它们外表安宁而祥和，内心却孤高且自傲。其身姿之壮硕，神态之高贵，令拥有高等智慧的人类也不由侧目。\n\n马虽外表温顺，然性格极刚烈，内心深处的竞争意识亦是其他生物所不及。须臾间飞驰而过，潇洒尽显无疑。\n\n马的气质与Belongs的气质，有太多相近之处。所以在我们的作品元素中，马将始终是最独特、最罕有的存在。\n\n人生旅途，悲欢离合，但愿你我好似骏马——仍然自由自我，永远高唱我歌，走遍千里",
      "en": "The horse is handsome, strong and upright, proud by nature, brave and spirited.\n\nOriginally a wild, mythical creature of the grasslands, untamed and freedom-loving, it bathes in rain, dew and sunlight, nourished by the essence of heaven and earth.\n\nOutwardly calm and peaceful, inwardly solitary and proud, their powerful forms and noble bearing make even highly intelligent humans stop and look.\n\nThough gentle in appearance, the horse has a fierce temperament and an extraordinary competitive spirit. A fleeting gallop shows its effortless grace.\n\nThe character of the horse has much in common with Belongs. Among our motifs, it will always hold a particularly distinctive and rare place.\n\nThrough life's joy, sorrow, meetings and partings, may we be like horses: free, true to ourselves, singing our own song across a thousand miles."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "马",
      "en": "Horse"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
