  "legacy:2021-225-3d46972a33": {
    "title": {
      "source": "悄然抬头，秋天已经来临",
      "en": "A Quiet Glance Up, and Autumn Is Here"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "十字架L\n一面手工金花配唐草，一面LOGO点金配唐草雕刻。\n十字架S\n正面手工金花，背面手工雕刻配LOGO点银。\n银牌\n首次推出区别于银饼的银牌。较之于银饼风格更简约，整体更加清爽，厚重感低于银饼。\n正面手工金花，背面游隼雕刻。\n平打宽戒\n首次推出宽版平打戒指，唐草雕刻配手工金花苞。尺码为日码14。\nB戒\n手工双花平打点金戒指，唐草雕刻配手工双金花与LOGO点金。尺码为日码14。",
      "en": "L Cross\nOne side has a handmade gold flower with scrolling vines; the other has a LOGO gold accent with scrolling-vine carving.\nS Cross\nFront: handmade gold flower. Back: hand carving with a LOGO silver accent.\nSilver Tag\nOur first silver tags, distinct from the silver discs. Compared with the discs, they are simpler in style, cleaner overall and less substantial in feel.\nFront: handmade gold flower. Back: peregrine falcon carving.\nWide Flat-Hammered Ring\nOur first wide flat-hammered ring, with scrolling-vine carving and a handmade gold flower bud. Japanese size 14.\nB Ring\nHandmade two-flower flat-hammered gold-accented ring, with scrolling-vine carving, two handmade gold flowers and a LOGO gold accent. Japanese size 14."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "悄然抬头，秋天已经来临",
      "en": "A Quiet Glance Up, and Autumn Is Here"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
  "legacy:2021-227-ec31f98419": {
    "title": {
      "source": "辛丑，七月初七",
      "en": "Xinchou Year, Seventh Day of the Seventh Lunar Month"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "七这个数字，有些特别。\n中国自古有阴阳与五行之和的传统。而西方传说则是六日创世，第七日休息。\n各个文明中，7都被广泛视为吉祥幸运的象征。\n于是，我们今天把代表好运与祝福的几件作品分享给大家。\n特别版熔币饼\n正面双鹰，手工金花、金孔。\n背面双花卷叶雕刻，金花蕊。\n刻Gaze（凝望）。",
      "en": "There is something special about seven.\nChinese tradition brings together yin and yang with the five elements. Western tradition tells of six days of creation and rest on the seventh.\nAcross civilizations, seven is widely regarded as a symbol of good fortune.\nToday we share a few pieces carrying good luck and good wishes.\nSpecial-Edition Melted-Coin Disc\nFront: two eagles, handmade gold flower and gold-lined hole.\nBack: two flowers and scrolling-leaf carving, with gold flower centers.\nInscribed \"Gaze.\""
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "辛丑，七月初七",
      "en": "Xinchou Year, Seventh Day of the Seventh Lunar Month"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
