  "legacy:2021-242-0f395a12cb": {
    "title": {
      "source": "蝉不鸣，夏已末",
      "en": "The Cicadas Fall Silent; Summer Is Ending"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "做出投身手工银饰制作的决定，已经记不清究竟是在哪一个瞬间。\n而点亮那些不眠夜的，也恰好是胸中这不灭的小小火焰。\n无数次面对困难时的坚持，许是坚信有意义的人生，当要在世间遗留美好、种下希望。\n一切的回答，不外乎坚持自我、固守原创。\n对潮湿烦闷的夏天，轻道一声再见。\n熔币银牌\n鹰盾大点金、飞鹰阳光雕刻。",
      "en": "I can no longer recall the exact moment I decided to devote myself to handmade silver.\nThe same small, unextinguished flame within lit those sleepless nights.\nPerhaps our persistence through countless difficulties comes from believing that a meaningful life should leave beauty in the world and plant hope.\nThe answer is simply to stay true to ourselves and hold to originality.\nA quiet farewell to the damp, stifling summer.\nMelted-Coin Silver Tag\nLarge eagle-shield gold accent; flying-eagle and sunlight carving."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "蝉不鸣，夏已末",
      "en": "The Cicadas Fall Silent; Summer Is Ending"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
