  "legacy:2021-246-e6d1334792": {
    "title": {
      "source": "信使",
      "en": "The Messenger"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "Belongs的作品元素中，鹰是一个重要的主题。\n\n以上是“上帝画手”Akiane Kramarik的画作。\n\n迷途的旅人在漆黑的山洞中望着眼前结冰的湖面，不敢前行。而这时，作为“信使”的鹰出现，指引旅人勇敢踏上冰面，走出昏暗洞穴，迈向光明远方。\n\n所以在Belongs作品中，鹰所承载的含义是“勇敢前行，追寻光明”。无论顺遂之时，亦或艰辛时刻，我们都希望自己的作品如同信使一般，为大家带来勇气、希望与慰藉。这也正是我们坚持原创制作的初衷和意义所在。\n\n莫比乌斯镯（M）",
      "en": "The eagle is an important theme in Belongs' work.\n\nAbove is a painting by Akiane Kramarik, \"God's painter.\"\n\nA lost traveler in a dark cave looks at a frozen lake, afraid to go on. An eagle appears as a messenger, guiding the traveler bravely onto the ice, out of the cave and toward distant light.\n\nIn Belongs' work, the eagle means going forward with courage in search of light. In easy and difficult times alike, we hope our pieces act as messengers of courage, hope and comfort. This is why we continue to make original work.\n\nMobius bracelet (M)"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "信使",
      "en": "The Messenger"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
