  "legacy:2021-256-d36d5e6cf0": {
    "title": {
      "source": "蛇",
      "en": "Snake"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "蛇，蜿蜒，灵动而迅速，让人本能地心生敬畏。也许是如神话所言，它原本就是大地的主宰。\n在Belongs的作品元素中，蛇意指“自由前行、长久守护”。\n蛇元素特别套装：\n特制蛇头羽（金绳金牙）x1\n特制金蛇坠x1\n银石子珠x1\n点金绳扣x1\n古董琉璃珠若干",
      "en": "The snake, winding, agile and swift, inspires an instinctive awe. Perhaps, as myths suggest, it was once the ruler of the earth.\nIn Belongs' vocabulary, the snake means moving freely and offering lasting protection.\nSpecial snake-themed set:\nSpecial snake-head feather (gold cord, gold fangs) x1\nSpecial gold snake pendant x1\nSilver pebble bead x1\nGold-accent cord clasp x1\nAssorted antique glass beads"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "蛇",
      "en": "Snake"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
