  "legacy:2022-030-bc11a95789": {
    "title": {
      "source": "2022，2，22",
      "en": "2022，2，22"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "这是平凡的一天，仿佛也是不平凡的一天。\n数字的奥妙揭示宇宙的复杂深奥，指引人们靠近科学，改变生活，甚至去往外太空。\n于是我们心血来潮地打算纪念下这一天。\n无论你选择红色，还是蓝色药丸。无法改变的，便是情感。\n人所以为人，只因它的存在。手工银饰同样如此。\n时代越喧嚣，越该审视内心，回归本真。\n喜怒哀乐，成此世界。\n两百年后，不再有你，亦不再有我。\n而曾经炽烈燃烧的真情，就像那矩阵中的数字，永不消逝。\n*配乐来自德国乐队There is a Light作品《We Choose To Go To The Moon》\n*展示作品完成于北京时间2022年2月22日凌晨2时许。",
      "en": "An ordinary day, and perhaps an extraordinary one.\nThe mystery of numbers reveals the universe's complexity, leading us toward science, changing life and even taking us into outer space.\nSo we decided on a whim to commemorate this day.\nWhether you choose the red pill or the blue, feeling is something you cannot change.\nIt is what makes us human. Handmade silver is no different.\nThe noisier the times, the more we should look within and return to what is true.\nJoy, anger, sorrow and happiness make this world.\nTwo hundred years from now, neither you nor I will remain.\nBut the feelings that once burned so fiercely, like numbers in the Matrix, will not disappear.\n*Music: \"We Choose To Go To The Moon\" by the German band There is a Light.\n*The piece shown was completed at around 2 a.m. Beijing time on February 22, 2022."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "2022，2，22",
      "en": "2022，2，22"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
  "legacy:2022-032-8c172d20e7": {
    "title": {
      "source": "文化与格调",
      "en": "Culture and Character"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "从诞生之初，复古文化就是少数人的专属。单宁、古布、蓝染、编织，充分体现手工的参与和对传统的致敬，与现代工厂流水线制造形成对比。\n作为复古文化的一部分，手作银饰同样需要拥有、也必须拥有这些特性。\n国际复古文化历经的发展路线，中国同样也会经历。\n但地域不同，历史不同，品牌不同，最终呈现的文化格调，必然不同。\n每个时代，都有文化的开创者与亲历者。从盛唐到现代，文明不灭，文化便不断繁盛。\nBelongs只是在努力做好自己。\n本期作品：\n莫比乌斯镯\n羽翼、鹰首、双点金",
      "en": "From its beginnings, vintage culture has belonged to a minority. Denim, old cloth, indigo dyeing and weaving express handwork and respect for tradition, in contrast to modern factory production lines.\nAs part of vintage culture, handmade silver needs, and must have, these qualities too.\nChina will also follow the developmental paths that international vintage culture has taken.\nDifferent places, histories and brands inevitably give rise to different cultural characters.\nEvery era has cultural pioneers and participants. From the Tang dynasty to today, culture continues to flourish as long as civilization endures.\nBelongs is simply trying to do its own work well.\nPieces in this release:\nMobius bracelet\nWings, eagle head, two gold accents"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "文化与格调",
      "en": "Culture and Character"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
