  "legacy:2022-040-b6de9864d6": {
    "title": {
      "source": "二月初二",
      "en": "The Second Day of the Second Lunar Month"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "陀思妥耶夫斯基说过：\n建塔的目的并不是为了从地上登天，而是把天挪到地上来。\n一横一折、一曲一直；宇宙苍茫，万物生长。\n我们的肉体，何其渺小；我们的灵魂，海纳百川。\n作为大自然的转述者，我们把这些浑然天成的美，在方寸之间的银饰上，呈现给大家。\n寻找无处不在的美丽，铸成胸前、指间、身旁的小小宇宙。\n这是我们对手作银饰的理解。\n你种下什么种子，便得到什么果实。\n本期内容：\n鹰头坠",
      "en": "Dostoevsky once said:\nThe purpose of building the tower was not to climb from earth to heaven, but to bring heaven down to earth.\nA stroke and a turn, a curve and a straight line; the universe is vast, and all things grow.\nOur bodies are so small; our souls can hold an ocean.\nAs interpreters of nature, we present its uncontrived beauty within a small piece of silver.\nSeeking beauty everywhere, we form small universes for the chest, the fingers and the space beside us.\nThis is how we understand handmade silver.\nWhat you plant determines what you harvest.\nIn this release:\nEagle-head pendant"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "二月初二",
      "en": "The Second Day of the Second Lunar Month"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
