  "legacy:2022-086-0b33f979b6": {
    "title": {
      "source": "守望",
      "en": "Keeping Watch"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "大海守望风帆，蓝天守望飞鸟，\n父母守望子女，爱人守望爱情，\n………\n这大概是最朴实无华的情感，静静地把你放在心里，任岁月变迁，依然在这里默默的守望。简单的两个字，却是一生的执念，承载着爱与承诺。\n愿大家珍惜属于自己的守望，保守爱与被爱的承诺。\n前路漫漫，我们守望初心，砥砺前行。\n说明：\n*请大家按优先选择顺序编辑编码并发送至官方微信，位数不限。\n*发送单条编码消息之后，请大家耐心等待。请勿连续发送消息反复询问，因为这将造成工作混乱、进展缓慢。\n*完成支付即代表确认购买。\n本期内容：\n1 -> S十字架（守望鹰首点金、背刻羽草）\n2 -> 银饼（守望鹰首点金、背绘唐草、鹰刻印）\n3 -> M十字架（守望鹰首点金、背刻展翅，符节点银）\n4 -> 随形鹰钩坠（守望鹰首点金、背绘唐草、鹰刻印）",
      "en": "The sea watches over sails, the sky over birds;\nparents watch over children, lovers over love.\n………\nPerhaps this is the simplest feeling: keeping you quietly in the heart, staying here through changing years, silently watching over you. Two simple Chinese characters hold a lifetime's devotion, love and promises.\nMay you cherish your own watchfulness and keep the promise to love and be loved.\nThe road is long. We keep watch over our original intention and press on.\nNotes:\n*Send your item codes, in order of preference, to the official WeChat account. There is no limit to the number listed.\n*After sending one code message, please wait patiently. Repeated messages and inquiries disrupt the work and slow progress.\n*Payment confirms the purchase.\nIn this release:\n1 -> S Cross (watchful eagle-head gold accent, feather-and-vine engraving on the back)\n2 -> Silver disc (watchful eagle-head gold accent, scrolling-vine back drawing, eagle stamp)\n3 -> M Cross (watchful eagle-head gold accent, spread wings engraved on the back, Tally silver accent)\n4 -> Free-form eagle-hook pendant (watchful eagle-head gold accent, scrolling-vine back drawing, eagle stamp)"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "守望",
      "en": "Keeping Watch"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
  "legacy:2022-087-b0866564df": {
    "title": {
      "source": "安好",
      "en": "Be Well"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "亲历方知不易，热爱方知珍惜，这一周发售如约而至。愿疫情消散，山河无恙，你我皆安好。\n感谢过去一周大家的关心与问候。\n说明：\n*请大家按优先选择顺序编辑编码并发送至官方微信，位数不限。\n*发送单条编码消息之后，请大家耐心等待。请勿连续发送消息反复询问，因为这将造成工作混乱、进展缓慢。\n*完成支付即代表确认购买。\n本期内容：\n1 -> B戒指（日码11.5码、羽翼点金、画笔羽、符节点银）\n2 -> S饼（符节点玫瑰金、唐草雕刻）\n3 -> 平打戒指（日码16码、符节点金、蛇骨&唐草主题、内刻）\n4 -> 银饼L（远翔鹰点金、写意鹰、草背刻）\n5 ->莫比乌斯镯（M码、手作花点金、鹰刻）",
      "en": "Only through experience do we know the hardship; only through love do we learn to cherish. This week's release is here as promised. May the pandemic pass, the land be safe, and you and I be well.\nThank you for your care and messages over the past week.\nNotes:\n*Send your item codes, in order of preference, to the official WeChat account. There is no limit to the number listed.\n*After sending one code message, please wait patiently. Repeated messages and inquiries disrupt the work and slow progress.\n*Payment confirms the purchase.\nIn this release:\n1 -> B ring (Japanese size 11.5, Wings gold accent, paintbrush feather, Tally silver accent)\n2 -> S disc (Tally rose gold accent, scrolling-vine carving)\n3 -> Flat-hammered ring (Japanese size 16, Tally gold accent, Serpent Bone & scrolling-vine theme, interior engraving)\n4 -> Silver disc L (far-flying eagle gold accent, freehand eagle, vines engraved on the back)\n5 -> Mobius bracelet (size M, handmade flower gold accent, eagle engraving)"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "安好",
      "en": "Be Well"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
