  "legacy:2023-006-f58305ebc4": {
    "title": {
      "source": "2.14",
      "en": "2.14"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "蛇，蜿蜒、灵动而敏捷，\n犀利而坚定的眼神，让人不由心生敬畏。也许如同神话所言，它本是大地的主宰，本能的的守卫着自己的家园。\n永世承诺，无言守护。\n情人节大蛇盾套装\n外形手工敲制。蛇背，爱心框BK字母唐草雕刻、符节点金、金眼；蛇腹，绽放金花眼镜蛇蕊雕刻、刻GURAD字样。唐草钩链配4.0规格丸链。\n购买方式：\n须满足条件获取参与资格\n*拥有一件及以上常规发售的作品；\n*非单身人士；\n*2.14当日佩戴Belongs单品并拍局部照，微信形式分享给Lydia，并留言文字表达购买理由；\n*满足条件后，凭借文字理由的充分度选出获得购买权的玩家；\n*参与截止时间为2月14日下午2:14分；\n*需要时间去仔细阅读每位玩家的购买理由，无法估算确认时间，请耐心等候，结束会以朋友圈形式告知。",
      "en": "The serpent: winding, fluid, swift.\nIts sharp, steady gaze commands respect. Perhaps, as the myths say, it is a ruler of the earth, guarding its home by instinct.\nAn enduring promise, a silent protection.\nValentine's Day Large Serpent Shield Set\nHand-hammered form. On the serpent's back: BK letters within a heart, scrolling-vine engraving, gold tally accent and gold eyes. On its belly: a blooming gold flower with a carved cobra center and the inscription GURAD. Scrolling-vine hook clasp with a size 4.0 round-link chain.\nHow to purchase:\nTo be eligible:\n*Own at least one piece from a regular release.\n*Be in a relationship.\n*On February 14, wear a Belongs piece and send Lydia a detail photo on WeChat, with a message explaining why you would like this piece.\n*Once the conditions are met, collectors will be chosen for the right to purchase based on how fully they explain their reasons;\n*Entries close at 2:14 pm on February 14.\n*We need time to read each message carefully and cannot give a decision time. Please wait; we will post on WeChat Moments when selection is complete."
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "2.14",
      "en": "2.14"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
