    "caption": {
      "source": "道阻且长，行则将至，\n行而不辍，未来可期。\n寄予果敢而坚毅，伴君乘风破浪，如鹰随行。\n说明：\n*请大家按优先选择顺序编辑编码并发送至官方微信，位数不限。\n*发送单条编码消息之后，请大家耐心等待。请勿连续发送消息反复询问，因为这将造成工作混乱、进展缓慢。\n*完成支付即代表确认购买。\n*发售结束会在朋友圈统一说明，不做一一回复。\n本期内容：\n1 -> 新鹰首（沙漏点金，背刻）\n2 -> 新鹰首（远翔鹰点金，背刻）\n3 ->M十字（点信使鹰点金银牌，背刻）",
      "en": "The road is long and difficult, but walk it and you will arrive,\nkeep walking, and there is a future to look forward to.\nMay it carry courage and resolve, riding the wind and waves with you, an eagle by your side.\nNotes:\n*Send your item codes, in order of preference, to the official WeChat account. There is no limit to the number listed.\n*After sending one code message, please wait patiently. Repeated messages and inquiries disrupt the work and slow progress.\n*Payment confirms the purchase.\n*We will announce the end of the release on WeChat Moments rather than reply individually.\nIn this release:\n1 -> New eagle head (gold hourglass accent, engraving on the back)\n2 -> New eagle head (gold soaring-eagle accent, engraving on the back)\n3 -> M Cross (silver tag with gold messenger-eagle accent, engraving on the back)"
    },
