  "legacy:2023-008-8d9e14725b": {
    "title": {
      "source": "我的春天里藏着一曲雏菊。",
      "en": "A Song of Daisies, Hidden in My Spring"
    },
    "caption": {
      "source": "和风吹醒了大地，吹醒了甜睡中的你；\n你伸了个懒腰，抖了抖肩膀上的泥，\n环望四周，此时漫山遍野都是你；\n你向着阳光微笑，你迎着劲风摇曳，\n一丛丛欢愉的精灵，一曲曲浪漫的旋律；\n就这样，你哼着歌，我哼着你；\n就这样，你负责绽放，我负责铭记；\n最后，我把你藏进我的春天，藏进我的心。\n说明：\n*请大家按优先选择顺序编辑编码并发送至官方微信，位数不限。\n*发送单条编码消息之后，请大家耐心等待。请勿连续发送消息反复询问，因为这将造成工作混乱、进展缓慢。\n*完成支付即代表确认购买。\n*发售结束会在朋友圈统一说明，不做一一回复。\n本期内容：\n1 -> K戒（符节金雏菊花、刻Blossom）\n2 -> B戒（符节点金、内B点金、刻Pure）\n3 -> 平打戒指（雏菊点金、刻Vitality）\n4 -> 莫比乌斯戒指（雏菊点金、金钉、刻Eternity）",
      "en": "A gentle breeze wakes the earth, and wakes you from sweet sleep;\nYou stretch and shake the soil from your shoulders.\nYou look around: now the hills and fields are full of you;\nYou smile toward the sunlight and sway in the strong wind,\nclusters of joyful spirits, one romantic melody after another;\nAnd so, you hum a song, and I hum you;\nAnd so, you bloom, and I remember;\nAt last, I tuck you into my spring, into my heart.\nNotes:\n*Send your item codes, in order of preference, to the official WeChat account. There is no limit to the number listed.\n*After sending one code message, please wait patiently. Repeated messages and inquiries disrupt the work and slow progress.\n*Payment confirms the purchase.\n*We will announce the end of the release on WeChat Moments rather than reply individually.\nIn this release:\n1 -> K ring (gold daisy on the tally motif, inscribed Blossom)\n2 -> B ring (gold tally accent, gold B accent inside, inscribed Pure)\n3 -> Flat-forged ring (gold daisy accent, inscribed Vitality)\n4 -> Mobius ring (gold daisy accent, gold stud, inscribed Eternity)"
    },
    "heading": {
      "source": "我的春天里藏着一曲雏菊。",
      "en": "A Song of Daisies, Hidden in My Spring"
    },
    "lead": {
      "source": "",
      "en": ""
    }
  },
